Paev
$cards
DECK 2 {SPADES, HEARTS, CLUBS, DIAMONDS}

$initial
DRAW 68 ROTATE 1 U 3
UHEAV 3 FACE_ALL
UHEAV 2 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
UHEAV 9 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
UHEAV 8 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

KAELAH 2 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

GEY 3 FACE_HALF

XIOVAP 9 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE KAELAH UHEAV
DEST Empty
MOVE UHEAV KAELAH
AND
    OR
        DESTSRC Rank equal
        DEST Size == 10
    DEST Size < 10
MOVE_STACK XIOVAP XIOVAP
AND
    OR
        SRC Suit {SPADES, CLUBS, DIAMONDS, HEARTS}
        DEST Rank K
    OR
        SRCSTACK Rank add_13
        SRCSTACK Size >= 4
MOVE_STACK XIOVAP UHEAV
AND
    SRCSTACK Size < 9
    OR
        DEST Empty
        SRCSTACK Suit match
$win
PILE ALL XIOVAP Empty
